{
  "schemaVersion": "0.2.0",
  "kind": "graph",
  "generatedAt": "2026-10-05T03:14:04.594Z",
  "title": "osf review: multi-agent PR review pipeline",
  "summary": "Adds a whole review subsystem to osf: a lens catalogue (20 shipped lenses plus repository overrides), a reviewer roster driven by `[agents]` in osf.toml, per-reviewer headless runs in a clean copy of the change, quote verification of every finding against the real files, a deterministic reducer that turns answers into a verdict, and a `pull_request_target` workflow that builds osf from the base branch, runs codex/claude/opencode each with only its own key, then reduces and posts. It also reworks suppression ownership so a marker naming another checker's rule is neither applied nor reported unused, and adds `--no-suppress` for CI.",
  "lenses": [
    "architecture",
    "data-flow"
  ],
